{"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI"]]},"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI8SettingsV","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Settings","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Settings"}],"title":"Settings","symbolKind":"struct"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Settings","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Content","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Content","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4ViewP","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/View"}]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use a settings scene to have OpenSwiftUI manage views with controls for your"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app’s settings when you declare your app using the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/App"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"When you use an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/App"},{"type":"text","text":" declaration for multiple platforms, compile the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"settings scene only in Windows:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["@main","struct MyApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            ContentView()","        }","        #if os(Windows)","        Settings {","            SettingsView()","        }","        #endif","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Passing a view as the argument to a settings scene in the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/App"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"declaration causes OpenSwiftUI to enable the app’s Settings menu item."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OpenSwiftUI manages displaying and removing the settings view when the user"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"selects the Settings item from the application menu or the equivalent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keyboard shortcut:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The contents of your settings view are controls that modify bindings"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UserDefaults"},{"type":"text","text":" values that OpenSwiftUI manages using the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/AppStorage"},{"type":"text","text":" property wrapper:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["struct GeneralSettingsView: View {","    @AppStorage(\"showPreview\") private var showPreview = true","    @AppStorage(\"fontSize\") private var fontSize = 12.0","","    var body: some View {","        Form {","            Toggle(\"Show Previews\", isOn: $showPreview)","            Slider(value: $fontSize, in: 9...96) {","                Text(\"Font Size (\\(fontSize, specifier: \"%.0f\") pts)\")","            }","        }","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can define your settings in a single view, or you can use a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TabView"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to group settings into different collections:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["struct SettingsView: View {","    var body: some View {","        TabView {","            Tab(\"General\", systemImage: \"gear\") {","                GeneralSettingsView()","            }","            Tab(\"Advanced\", systemImage: \"star\") {","                AdvancedSettingsView()","            }","        }","        .scenePadding()","        .frame(maxWidth: 350, minHeight: 100)","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/settings"]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene that presents an interface for viewing and modifying an app’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"settings."}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Settings\/init(content:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Settings\/body"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Settings\/Scene-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Settings"},"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Settings/init(content:)":{"url"